<speak>
<s>This is your Jumu'ah briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">31072026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>A phased plan to disarm Hamas has been announced for Gaza, and neither Hamas nor Israel has signed it.</s> <s>An official of the so-called Board of Peace put the process at two hundred to three hundred and twenty days, yet named no inspector to verify a single step of it — and disarmament is the one clause in any ceasefire that can only be settled by inspection.</s> <s>Israel's already rejected the draft's fifteen points, Hamas refuses to disarm while Israeli forces remain, and for people under siege in Gaza nothing in the announcement changes tomorrow.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Eighteen miners are dead and fourteen still unaccounted for after a methane explosion at a coal complex in Pakistan's Balochistan, four thousand feet down.</s> <s>Thirty-six men were inside, and the conditions that killed them are known in advance — small private leases worked by hand, gas-heavy seams with no continuous monitoring, single shafts with no second way out, and an inspectorate of a handful of men for thousands of pits.</s> <s>The chief mine inspector says survival chances are low, and the province whose coal and gas finance the state is once again the province where nobody polices the extraction.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nicaragua deported two hundred and twenty-two prisoners and then stripped them of their nationality altogether.</s> <s>Law eleven forty-five lets the National Assembly declare a critic a traitor to the homeland and revoke citizenship by decree, which doesn't produce an exile... it produces a stateless person, with no passport, no residence anywhere by right, no property they can defend and no pension.</s> <s>The nineteen sixty-one Statelessness Convention forbids exactly this, and carries no enforcement mechanism at all.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Between fifteen hundred and two thousand people crossed into the Spanish enclave of Ceuta in ten days, swimming around the breakwater.</s> <s>Ceuta is European Union territory on the African continent, and what normally holds that border shut isn't the fence but Morocco's gendarmerie — a patrol Rabat has withdrawn before, in twenty twenty-one, as leverage over Western Sahara.</s> <s>Spain's Supreme Court barred summary returns last month, so Madrid's sending troops to a border whose tap is turned in another country's capital.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Britain's Supreme Court will hear an appeal against the proscription of Palestine Action, a ban under which more than three thousand five hundred people have already been arrested.</s> <s>Proscription is a minister's order, laid before parliament as a yes-or-no with no amendment, and it converts speech and association into terrorism offences without any court ever finding the group did anything.</s> <s>The hearing's expected between October and December, and prosecutions continue in the meantime.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Reporters spent two days walking the Cuban site that an American administration described as bristling with antennas — a Russian spy base at Lourdes.</s> <s>What stands there now is Cuba's computer-science university, and the claim reached readers through The New York Times without anyone visiting the ground it described.</s> <s>Neither the newspaper nor the State Department has answered requests for comment.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The race to lead the United Nations has begun, and five states can end a candidacy in secret.</s> <s>Council members mark each of seven candidates encourage or discourage on paper, and a single discourage from a veto power kills a bid with no public vote and no explanation owed to anyone.</s> <s>Costa Rica's Rebeca Grynspan leads after the first round, and the straw polls could run into October.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Kazakhstan's oil output has halved this month after its main export terminal shut.</s> <s>That route carries eighty percent of Kazakh crude across Russia's Black Sea coast — the same infrastructure Ukraine targets to disrupt Moscow's war — so a landlocked country's entire economy runs through a war zone it isn't party to.</s> <s>Its only alternatives run through Azerbaijan or China, and neither has the capacity to replace what's stopped.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The yen jumped against the dollar overnight on what traders read as an intervention, and Tokyo declined to confirm anything.</s> <s>Refusing to confirm is the instrument — an intervention works through uncertainty, and one analyst says Japan and South Korea acted jointly for the first time, which is a statement about the dollar rather than about either currency.</s> <s>The Bank of Japan held its rate at one percent on Friday, and the same dollar strength is squeezing the rupee, the taka and the Egyptian pound with far less to defend with.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Tesla is reported to be weighing a separation of its China business, a report Elon Musk has called fake news.</s> <s>The reason such a split would even be contemplated is structural: SpaceX holds American defence contracts closed to firms with Chinese links, while the Shanghai plant builds more than half of Tesla's global deliveries.</s> <s>Decoupling, described everywhere as policy, is in practice a corporate-structuring problem — and the question for Karachi, Jakarta and Lagos is which of the two companies will be allowed to sell to them.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Qualcomm has confirmed it's raising Snapdragon chip prices from the first of September, and it named the cause.</s> <s>Artificial intelligence data centres now take roughly half of global memory chip output, up from a third five years ago, and high-bandwidth memory comes off the same lines as phone memory at far higher margins, so there's no separate industry to shield anyone.</s> <s>Some reports put the next flagship chip at three hundred dollars more — a regressive tax on the only computer most of the world owns, levied by a capital-allocation decision made in California.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>A four-storey building collapsed in Bhiwandi, in India's Maharashtra, killing one person, with seven or eight still trapped.</s> <s>The structure had already been declared dangerous and repair work was underway when residents heard cracking and ran.</s> <s>National Disaster Response Force teams are searching the rubble of a building the state had already condemned on paper.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nigeria has pledged twenty-five thousand free cataract surgeries by twenty twenty-seven.</s> <s>Cataract surgery is short and cheap, so the binding constraint was never the operation — it's ophthalmologists and functioning theatres outside Lagos and Abuja, which is where almost none of them are.</s> <s>Funding sits in the twenty twenty-five and twenty twenty-six budgets, and implementation is the part that will be judged, God willing.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Hundreds of firefighters are working Mediterranean blazes on Turkey's coast near Antalya.</s> <s>Drought-dried fuel, sustained heat and one particular wind pattern turn a ground fire into a crown fire in minutes, and the season in which that conjunction is possible is lengthening across the eastern Mediterranean year by year.</s> <s>Turkey's forestry directorate hasn't yet given a containment figure.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Hackers tied to the Kremlin are exploiting a maximum-severity flaw in Microsoft Exchange that was patched back in July.</s> <s>Opening a single email is enough to trigger compromise, and researchers say the backdoor survives password resets and a complete device re-imaging — removal requires work on the Exchange server itself, which is precisely what under-resourced institutions never get to.</s> <s>An organisation's security is now inherited from its infrastructure, not chosen by it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Google is extending age checks to some three billion Android devices, reaching Australia and Canada by mid-August and the world by year's end.</s> <s>The signal comes from account history and behaviour, and escalates to a government identity document or a face scan — so a company becomes the arbiter of who's an adult, using inference first and biometrics second.</s> <s>What happens to a wrong guess, and who a user appeals to, hasn't been said.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>